      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Free Threading\n(Python >= 3.13)\n- Direct communication\n- Shared process\n- Multiple threads can\n  run simultaneously\n- Shared interpreter\n- No GIL\n- i.e. Threading\n",
      "fontSize": 62.39999999999996,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Free Threading\n(Python >= 3.13)\n- Direct communication\n- Shared process\n- Multiple threads can\n  run simultaneously\n- Shared interpreter\n- No GIL\n- i.e. Threading\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
